        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokobos 2 is a modern twist on the classic block-pushing formula, inspired by Greek tragedies. You must load all the vases into your cart, but the cart moves too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.poster.avif?t=1758304570\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.webm?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.mp4?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience small and handcrafted puzzles focused on &quot;aha!&quot; moments with interesting interactions and clever solutions. Some objects can be pushed into water to create a bridge, while others float and drift away with the current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both Sokoban newcomers and veterans alike! Sokobos 2 offers a unique twist and smooth learning curve that welcomes newcomers but respects their problem-solving later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Ancient Greece. You have upset the Gods, and collecting the vases for eternity is your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brief Summary</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cart isn't just a container, it's part of the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond vases and the cart, interact with gates, pressure plates, water mechanics, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals keeping the focus on puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaches new interactions clearly but trusts your problem-solving skills afterward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story inspired by Greek tragedies</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sokobos 2 is a modern twist on the classic block-pushing formula, inspired by Greek tragedies. You must load all the vases into your cart, but the cart moves too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.poster.avif?t=1758304570\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.webm?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422180/extras/ea65064ba38f2778fe835e6834b3d6a5.mp4?t=1758304570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience small and handcrafted puzzles focused on &quot;aha!&quot; moments with interesting interactions and clever solutions. Some objects can be pushed into water to create a bridge, while others float and drift away with the current.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both Sokoban newcomers and veterans alike! Sokobos 2 offers a unique twist and smooth learning curve that welcomes newcomers but respects their problem-solving later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Ancient Greece. You have upset the Gods, and collecting the vases for eternity is your punishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brief Summary</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 3 hours of playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cart isn't just a container, it's part of the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond vases and the cart, interact with gates, pressure plates, water mechanics, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist visuals keeping the focus on puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaches new interactions clearly but trusts your problem-solving skills afterward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story inspired by Greek tragedies</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A puzzle game about pushing vases into a cart, but you can push the cart too!",
        "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese",
        "reviews": "“Sokobos 2 offers a refined and engaging puzzle experience.”<br>9/10 – Treat Your Geek<br><br>“Compared to the first game, Sokobos 2 absolutely steps things up in almost every aspect.”<br>8.7/10 – 3rd Strike<br><br>“It's a solid little puzzle game that respects your time and your brain.”<br>8/10 – Gaming Couch Potato<br>",
